+    Recorded observation, not currently evidence. It states that BBB GPIO0_3
+    read the complete CPLD response when the boot overlay owned the four SPI
+    nets. Treat the GPIO-SPI fallback as supported by later work rather than
+    proven here; see corroboration below.
+
+corroboration:
+  purpose: >-
+    Runs that point the same way as the missing evidence. None of them replaces
